senses.gloss:
जप् JAP, Ⅰ. jápa-ti, japa-te (rarer), repeat 🞄in an undertone, mutter or murmur 🞄(prayers);
 pray silently;
 intv. jañjapyáte, 🞄mutter. upa, whisper to (ac., lc.);
 bring 🞄over to oneʼs side by whispering, instigate to 🞄rebellion. pari, mutter over (ac.). prati, 🞄whisper back.

जप jáp-a, a. whispering;
 m. muttering 🞄(prayers etc.);
 murmured prayer.

जाप jāp-a, m. muttering;
 -aka, a. reciting 🞄in a low tone (—˚);
 muttering prayers;
 m. 🞄priest who mutters prayers;
 -in, a. muttering, 🞄reciting in a low tone (—˚);
 -ya, fp. to be muttered;
 🞄n. muttered prayer.

जपमाला japa-mālā, f. rosary;
 -yajña, m. 🞄sacrifice of muttered prayer;
 -homa, m. sg. 🞄& pl. offering of muttered prayer: du. muttered 🞄prayer and an offering.
